{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0001", "offset": 14, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "主 혹 ‘髹’의 誤讀이 아닌가 한다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0002", "offset": 18, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "俠紵 원 판독문은 ‘任𧧦’이다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0003", "offset": 22, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "黃□耳棓 원 판독문은 ‘黃□瓦捨’이다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0004", "offset": 24, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "容 원 판독문은 ‘南’이다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0005", "offset": 40, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "塗 원 판독문은 ‘〓’이다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0006", "offset": 75, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "護工卒史 원 판독문은 ‘□工字史’이다.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020", "id": "gskh_009_0070_0020_0080_0020_0007", "offset": 84, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "〓辰紋正〓〓〓이 문장 중에 長·丞·掾의 관직 및 人名이 기록되었을 것이지만, 재판독은 힘들다.", "type": "각주"}
